WEBVTT

00:05:27.363 --> 00:05:33.097
and I did a bad thing
and let me address that

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:36.430
and make amends,

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:38.697
reconnect with my child

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:42.563
and think about ways
to avoid that going forward,”

00:05:42.597 --> 00:05:45.863
as opposed to getting mired
in shame, shame, shame.

00:05:45.897 --> 00:05:48.830
I think shame is such a selfish emotion.

00:05:48.863 --> 00:05:50.463
It's all about me.

00:05:50.863 --> 00:05:53.663
It's not about the person that I hurt.

00:05:53.697 --> 00:05:57.097
It's, "Me, me, me, me,
I'm a horrible person,"

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:02.363
which takes the focus off
of the person you've harmed.